Paste at selection start (not playhead)

Audacity 4 paste commands passed the playhead into pasteFromClipboard.
Cut/delete already use the time selection. Paste now uses
dataSelectedStartTime() as well, and pasteIntoNewTracks takes the same
begin time instead of reading the playhead again.

Apply against an Audacity 4.x tree:
  git apply 0003-paste-at-selection-start.patch

